#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:632
msgid "Skills"
msgstr "Skills"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:634
msgid ""
"Skills let you teach the Context Agent reusable instructions that it can "
"follow whenever they are relevant. A skill is a small markdown file that "
"describes a procedure, a set of rules, or domain-specific knowledge. Once a "
"skill is saved, the agent automatically picks it up and applies it in future"
" conversations without you having to repeat yourself."
msgstr ""
"Med skills kan du lære Context Agent genbrugelige instruktioner, som den kan"
" følge, når de er relevante. En skill er en lille Markdown-fil, der "
"beskriver en fremgangsmåde, et sæt regler eller viden om et bestemt område. "
"Når en skill er gemt, finder agenten den automatisk og bruger den i "
"fremtidige samtaler, uden at du behøver at gentage dig selv."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:0
msgid ""
"Skills require the Context Agent app version 2.8.0 or later and the "
"Assistant app version 3.5.0 or later."
msgstr ""
"Skills kræver Context Agent i version 2.8.0 eller nyere og Assistent i "
"version 3.5.0 eller nyere."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:0
msgid ""
"You can ask your administrator if these requirements are met or the agent "
"directly if it has the ability to use skills."
msgstr ""
"Du kan spørge din administrator, om kravene er opfyldt, eller spørge agenten"
" direkte, om den kan bruge skills."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:645
msgid "Where skills are stored"
msgstr "Her gemmes skills"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:647
msgid ""
"Your personal skills live in your Nextcloud Files under ``Context "
"Agent/Skills/`` inside the assistant data folder, so with the default folder"
" name that is ``Assistant/Context Agent/Skills/``."
msgstr ""
"Dine personlige skills ligger i Filer under ``Context Agent/Skills/`` i "
"assistentens datamappe. Med standardnavnet for mappen er det "
"``Assistant/Context Agent/Skills/``."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:651
msgid ""
"Each skill is a subfolder containing a file called ``SKILL.md``. The "
"``SKILL.md`` file starts with a YAML frontmatter block that defines the "
"skill's name and description, followed by the skill content in Markdown:"
msgstr ""
"Hver skill er en undermappe med en fil, der hedder ``SKILL.md``. Filen "
"``SKILL.md`` starter med en YAML-frontmatter-blok, der angiver skillens navn"
" og beskrivelse, efterfulgt af skillens indhold i Markdown:"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:668
msgid ""
"For example, a skill named \"weekly-report-format\" would be stored at "
"``Assistant/Context Agent/Skills/weekly-report-format/SKILL.md``."
msgstr ""
"En skill, der hedder \"weekly-report-format\", gemmes f.eks. i "
"``Assistant/Context Agent/Skills/weekly-report-format/SKILL.md``."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:671
msgid "A typical skills folder structure looks like this:"
msgstr "En typisk mappestruktur for skills ser sådan ud:"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:686
msgid "Creating a skill"
msgstr "Opret en skill"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:688
msgid "You can create a skill in two ways:"
msgstr "Du kan oprette en skill på to måder:"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:690
msgid ""
"Manually: create a subfolder under ``Assistant/Context Agent/Skills/`` in "
"your Files, then add a ``SKILL.md`` file with the frontmatter and content "
"shown above."
msgstr ""
"Manuelt: Opret en undermappe under ``Assistant/Context Agent/Skills/`` i "
"Filer, og tilføj derefter en fil, ``SKILL.md``, med frontmatter og indhold "
"som vist ovenfor."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:692
msgid ""
"Through the chat: ask the agent to create a skill for you. For example:"
msgstr ""
"Via chatten: Bed agenten om at oprette en skill for dig. For eksempel:"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:694
msgid ""
"\"Create a skill called 'email-tone' that reminds you to always write emails"
" in a friendly and professional tone.\""
msgstr ""
"\"Opret en skill, der hedder 'email-tone', som minder dig om altid at skrive"
" e-mails i en venlig og professionel tone.\""

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:696
msgid ""
"\"Save a skill for summarizing meeting notes with action items and owners.\""
msgstr "\"Gem en skill til at opsummere mødenoter med opgaver og ansvarlige.\""

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:698
msgid ""
"The agent will create the folder and ``SKILL.md`` file for you "
"automatically."
msgstr "Agenten opretter automatisk mappen og filen ``SKILL.md`` for dig."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:701
msgid "Listing and using skills"
msgstr "Vis og brug skills"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:703
msgid "To see which skills are available, ask the agent:"
msgstr "Spørg agenten for at se, hvilke skills der er tilgængelige:"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:705
msgid "\"List my skills.\""
msgstr "\"Vis mine skills.\""

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:707
msgid ""
"You do not need to explicitly invoke a skill. The agent reads all available "
"skill descriptions and applies the relevant ones based on the context of "
"your conversation."
msgstr ""
"Du behøver ikke at aktivere en skill. Agenten læser beskrivelserne af alle "
"tilgængelige skills og bruger de relevante ud fra sammenhængen i din "
"samtale."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:711
msgid "Admin-provided skills"
msgstr "Skills delt af administratoren"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:713
msgid ""
"Your administrator can configure a global skills folder that provides skills"
" to all users on the instance. These global skills appear alongside your "
"personal skills."
msgstr ""
"Din administrator kan sætte en global mappe med skills op, som gør skills "
"tilgængelige for alle brugere på instansen. De globale skills vises sammen "
"med dine personlige."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:716
msgid ""
"If a global skill has the same name as one of your personal skills, your "
"personal version takes precedence."
msgstr ""
"Hvis en fælles skill har samme navn som en af dine personlige skills, har "
"din personlige version forrang."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:720
msgid "Using Nextcloud as an MCP server"
msgstr "Brug Nextcloud som MCP-server"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:722
msgid ""
"The Context Agent app exposes your Nextcloud as a `Model Context Protocol "
"(MCP) <https://modelcontextprotocol.io>`_ server. This means you can connect"
" your Nextcloud instance to external AI tools and agents such as Pi Agent, "
"Claude Code, Hermes, OpenCode or any other MCP-compatible client and let "
"them use the same tools that are available in the Assistant chat."
msgstr ""
"Appen Context Agent gør din Nextcloud til en server med `Model Context "
"Protocol (MCP) <https://modelcontextprotocol.io>`_. Det betyder, at du kan "
"forbinde din Nextcloud-instans til eksterne AI-værktøjer og -agenter som Pi "
"Agent, Claude Code, Hermes, OpenCode eller en anden MCP-kompatibel klient og"
" lade dem bruge de samme værktøjer, som er tilgængelige i chatten i "
"Assistent."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:728
msgid "The MCP server endpoint is::"
msgstr "MCP-serverens endepunkt er::"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:732
msgid ""
"Authentication is done with an app password. You can create one in "
"\"Personal settings -> Security -> Devices & sessions\"."
msgstr ""
"Du logger ind med en app-adgangskode. Du kan oprette en under \"Personlige "
"indstillinger > Sikkerhed > Enheder og sessioner\"."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:736
msgid "Connecting MCP clients"
msgstr "Forbind MCP-klienter"

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:738
msgid ""
"Any MCP-compatible client that supports the ``streamable_http`` transport "
"can connect to the Nextcloud MCP server. Point the client to the endpoint "
"URL shown above and pass the app password in the ``Authorization: Bearer "
"<app-password>`` header."
msgstr ""
"Alle MCP-kompatible klienter, der understøtter transporten "
"``streamable_http``, kan oprette forbindelse til Nextclouds MCP-server. "
"Angiv endepunktets URL ovenfor i klienten, og send app-adgangskoden i "
"headeren ``Authorization: Bearer <app-password>``."

#: ../../ai_assistant.rst:742
msgid ""
"Once connected, the external client can use all the same Context Agent "
"tools, managing files, calendars, tasks, contacts, Talk conversations, and "
"more directly from outside Nextcloud."
msgstr ""
"Når klienten er forbundet, kan den bruge alle de samme værktøjer i Context "
"Agent og administrere filer, kalendere, opgaver, kontakter, samtaler i Talk "
"og meget mere direkte uden for Nextcloud."
